A binary built with UAPMD_ENABLE_BASIC_PITCH additionally embeds the Basic Pitch
model weights (nmp.onnx, 230,444 bytes) verbatim, downloaded at configure time
and hex encoded into a generated source file (basic_pitch_model_data.cpp, which
is produced in the build directory and is not part of the source tree). Those
weights are covered by the
same Apache License, and this NOTICE and the accompanying LICENSE must travel
with any such binary.

